Not merely remembering old artifacts. Re-vivifying them.

\text{fossil}
\xrightarrow{\text{new context}}
\text{living operator}

Every new Seal, distinction, or representation gives us another way to reread earlier material. That rereading can expose functionality that was latent but not yet addressable:

P_t
